  "content": "I died. I went HOME. I talked to my guardian. I came back. (I've completed the rest of this questionnaire it is after 8:00 am and I have not been to bed yet. Will do a more extensive account later, but most of what would be in here is scattered over the other questions. I live on one to three hours of sleep since the incident, two is a good amount. I notice the more 'on path' I am the less sleep I need. But if I don't get to bed by 9:00 am the whole idea passes until two or three in the next morning, sometimes I can do a half hour to an hour 'nap' in the afternoon, hum.)",
